sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant TenantSvc as Tenant Service
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant SettingSvc as Setting Service
    participant DB as Setting DB

    TenantSvc->>Kafka: tenant.provisioned
    Kafka->>SettingSvc: consume tenant.provisioned

    SettingSvc->>DB: Check company exists for tenant

    alt Company does not exist
        SettingSvc->>DB: BEGIN
        SettingSvc->>DB: Create Company<br/>status = PENDING
        SettingSvc->>DB: Initialize legal information<br/>from Tenant data
        SettingSvc->>DB: Create Company Setup Progress
        SettingSvc->>DB: Create mandatory setup steps
        SettingSvc->>DB: COMMIT
    else Company already exists
        SettingSvc->>SettingSvc: Ignore duplicate provisioning
    end